<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }


        .show-on-mobile-only {
            display: none;
            width: 100%;
        }


        .main-container {
            padding: 0;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }


        .w-fit {
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .h-fit {
            height: fit-content;
        }


        .container {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .p-x {
            padding-top: 0;
            padding-bottom: 0;
            padding-left: 50px;
            padding-right: 50px;
        }

        .no-padding {
            padding: 0;
        }



        .paragraph {
            font-size: 15px;
        }



        .header-box {
            background: #217946;
            display: flex;
            position: relative;
        }


        .header-box .image-container {
            display: flex;
        }


        .header-box .image-container img {
            margin-top: auto;
            margin-bottom: auto;
        }



        a {
            color: black;
        }

        .blue-link {
            color: blue;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: flex;
            border: solid 1px #F56900;
            width: fit-content;
        }

        .btn p {
            color: #F56900;
        }

        .colored-btn {
            background-color: #F56900;
        }

        .colored-btn p {
            color: white;
        }


        .header-box p,
        .header-box h2 {
            color: white;
        }


        .header-box .text-container {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 17px;
        }

        .title-1 {
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .title-2 {
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .margin-top {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .margin-2-top {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .margin-bottom {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }




        .margin-2-bottom {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }





        .project-table {
            background: #F569001A;
            border: solid 1px Orange;
            height: fit-content;
            width: 75%;
        }


        .table-item {
            display: flex;
        }



        .main-logo {
            width: 250px;
            height: 100px;
        }


        .project-table h2:nth-child(2) {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: start;
        }


        .table-title {
            width: 170px;
        }



        .footer img {
            width: 120px;
            height: 60px;
        }



        @media (max-width:700px) {


            .header-box .text-container {
                margin-top: 0;
            }

            .project-table {
                padding-left: 20px;
                width: auto;
            }

            .header-box .image-container img {
                display: none;
            }

            .show-on-mobile-only {
                display: flex;
                width: 100%;
                height: fit-content;
            }


            .show-on-mobile-only .main-logo {
                height: 80px;
                width: auto;
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
            }


            .title-1 {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .title-2 {
                font-size: 12px;
            }


            .table-title {
                width: 140px;
            }



            .header-box {
                display: block;
            }


            .p-x {
                padding-top: 0;
                padding-bottom: 0;
                padding-left: 20px;
                padding-right: 20px;
            }

        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>



    <div class="main-container">

        <div class="show-on-mobile-only no-padding margin-2-bottom">
            <img src="cid:colored-logo" alt="Example Image" class="main-logo">
        </div>


        {{!-- The header of the template --}}
        <div class="header-box container margin-2-bottom">


            <div class="no-padding text-container">

                <p>Onderwerp</p>
                <h2 class="title-1 margin-2-bottom">Je OTP-code voor beveiligde toegang</h2>

                <p class="margin-top">Projectnummer</p>
                {{!-- This is the project name --}}
                <h2 class="title-1">{{projectNumber}}</h2>

            </div>


            <div class="image-container">
                <img src="cid:logo" alt="Example Image" class="main-logo">
            </div>

        </div>



        {{!-- The text for dear GreenTeam --}}
        <div class="p-x  margin-2-bottom">

            <h2 class="margin-bottom title-1">Beste {{subcontractorName}},</h2>

            <p class="paragraph margin-bottom">
                We hebben een verzoek ontvangen om je accountwachtwoord te resetten. Om de veiligheid van uw account te
                waarborgen, gebruikt je de volgende OTP (One-Time Password) om het resetproces te voltooien.
            </p>



        </div>




        {{!-- OTP code --}}
        <div class="p-x  margin-2-bottom">

            <h2 class="margin-bottom title-1">Uw OTP-code</h2>
            <h1>123456</h1>

        </div>



        {{!-- Important list --}}
        <div class="p-x  margin-2-bottom">

            <h2 class="margin-bottom title-2">Belangrijk</h2>
            <ul style="padding-left: 30px;">
                <li>Deze OTP-code is 10 minuten geldig en kan slechts één keer worden gebruikt.</li>
                <li>Als je de OTP-code niet binnen het aangegeven tijdsbestek gebruikt, moet je een nieuwe aanvragen.
                </li>
            </ul>

        </div>




        <div class="footer p-x">

            <p class="paragraph margin-bottom">
                Als je geen verzoek heeft ingediend om uw account te resetten of als je verdachte activiteiten vermoedt,
                neem dan onmiddellijk contact op met ons ondersteuningsteam via <strong>085 401 93 45</strong> of
                <strong>info@greenteam.nl</strong>.
            </p>



            <p class="paragraph margin-bottom">Met vriendelijke groet,</p>

            <div class="margin-top">

                <p class="paragraph margin-bottom" style="font-weight: bold;">GreenTeam</p>
                <p class="paragraph margin-bottom">Vloeren & Trappen</p>

            </div>

        </div>


    </div>

</body>

</html>